    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, that feels like just trying to distract myself. if you look at it logically though, if the universe is just random chaos and there's no objective purpose, then all outcomes are basically equal. if life is a net zero, then choosing to end it is just as valid as choosing to stay. it's just math, really.",
