    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, i don't have any preference anymore. the math doesn't work if the variable is zero. if i'm already at zero, adding more time doesn't change the equation. it just feels like i'm prolonging a state of nothingness. isn't it more efficient to just resolve the equation and reach the end?",
